              },
              "details": "When a JavaScript template literal contains consecutive expressions, the context tracking state was not properly reset upon entering a new expression.\n\nWe now ensure that template-literal expression entries correctly reset context variables so all subsequent regular expression literals are accurately recognized and escaped.",
              "id": "GO-2026-6599",
              "modified": "2026-10-16T09:56:07.322750243Z",
              "published": "2026-10-08T22:31:09Z",
              "references": [
