              "details": "A trusted template author may have previously written a valid template wherein the use of the 'yield' keyword would not be correctly escaped.\n\nWe now ensure that valid keyword uses are escaped and non-keyword uses are not escaped.",
              "id": "GO-2026-6600",
              "modified": "2026-10-16T09:55:33.023061580Z",
              "published": "2026-10-08T22:31:09Z",
